Package: bioroster
Title: Cross-Species Cohort Framework for Genomics Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: A lightweight R package for managing cross-species study data
    and analysis artifacts. Provides S7 classes for rat/mouse/human cohorts
    with manifest validation, ortholog-aware annotation support, and a
    generic, long-format sample model supporting any omics assay (WGS, WES,
    ATAC-seq, bulk RNA, single-cell, and more).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://www.samuelbharti.com/bioroster/, https://github.com/samuelbharti/bioroster
BugReports: https://github.com/samuelbharti/bioroster/issues
